OL,3,AJonathan Ross's daughter Honey is
OL,4,Alearning Welsh and practising on her
OL,5,Adog
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Welsh content creator has shared how
OL,8,Fhis girlfriend Honey Ross, daughter of
OL,9,FTV presenter Jonathan Ross, is learning
OL,10,FWelsh.
OL,12,FYouTuber Gav Murphy, 41, said Honey,
OL,13,F28, has been learning his native
OL,14,Flanguage via the Duolingo app and has
OL,15,Fbeen practising speaking it to their
OL,16,Fdog, Coco.
OL,18,FThe pair met on Instagram, but
OL,19,Fimmediately hit it off after
OL,20,Fdiscovering their shared love for
OL,21,Ffilms.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
